    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "That's a textbook scam pattern: owner away, keys by mail, deposit via Zelle before you see it. Don't send anything.\n\nIf you want to test it: ask for a live video walkthrough at a time you choose, and for the address so you can check the building. Scammers usually disappear or make excuses. Report the listing on Craigslist."
     ]
    },
