  "6aad253e-931e-499c-bd9a-1049284e4491": {
   "id": "6aad253e-931e-499c-bd9a-1049284e4491",
   "message": {
    "id": "6aad253e-931e-499c-bd9a-1049284e4491",
    "author": {
     "role": "assistant",
     "name": null,
     "metadata": {}
    },
    "create_time": 1784082933.986,
    "update_time": null,
    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "Good questions to ask the incubator (Surplus, or whoever runs it):\n- Monthly cost, what's included (utilities, internet, cleaning), deposit, and the **notice period** to leave.\n- Private room vs. shared; number of people per bathroom.\n- Can you stay past the program end, and at what rate?\n- House rules: guests, quiet hours, work hours in common areas.\n- Is it month-to-month? (Ideal as a landing spot while you look.)\n- Mail/package handling, and whether you can use the address for things like a CA driver's license.\n\nMonth-to-month at the house with a 30-day notice is the safest first step; look for a sublet once you know the city."
     ]
    },
